t' is defined but never used.","Identifier","unusedVar","jsx-a11y/anchor-is-valid","The href attribute requires a valid value to be accessible. Provide a valid, navigable address as the href value. If you cannot provide a valid href, but still need the element to resemble a link, use a button and change it with appropriate styles. Learn more: https://github.com/jsx-eslint/eslint-plugin-jsx-a11y/blob/HEAD/docs/rules/anchor-is-valid.md","jsx-a11y/alt-text","Invalid alt value for img. Use alt=\"\" for presentational images.","img elements must have an alt prop, either with meaningful text, or an empty string for decorative images.","jsx-a11y/iframe-has-title","<iframe> elements must have a unique title property.","Imported JSX component Add_courses must be in PascalCase or SCREAMING_SNAKE_CASE","Imported JSX component Manage_courses must be in PascalCase or SCREAMING_SNAKE_CASE","Imported JSX component Add_team must be in PascalCase or SCREAMING_SNAKE_CASE","Imported JSX component Manage_team must be in PascalCase or SCREAMING_SNAKE_CASE","Imported JSX component Add_testimonial must be in PascalCase or SCREAMING_SNAKE_CASE","Imported JSX component Manage_testimonial must be in PascalCase or SCREAMING_SNAKE_CASE","Imported JSX component Manage_student must be in PascalCase or SCREAMING_SNAKE_CASE","Imported JSX component Manage_contact must be in PascalCase or SCREAMING_SNAKE_CASE","'res' is assigned a value but never used."]